# Bundled known-WPS-PIN database for autopwn-ng
# Format: <OUI_PREFIX (6 hex, uppercase)>  <PIN (8 digits)>  [# comment]
# One entry per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Lookup is by the first 3 octets of the BSSID.
#
# This list is intentionally small and conservative. Extend it with
# verified OUI -> default-PIN pairs for your environment; algorithmic
# PINs (ComputePIN, D-Link, ...) are always tried in addition.
C83A35  12345670  # example entry (replace/extend with verified pairs)
001122  98765432  # test fixture entry
EOF